  m_text: "Hey! Are you busy? I need your help.\r\n\r\nI was doing an assignment
    when strange pop-ups suddenly appeared. One said my laptop had a virus and needed
    an immediate scan. I\u2019m not sure if it\u2019s real or a scam.\r\n\r\nI haven\u2019t
    clicked anything yet. Can you help me figure out what to do?\r\n"
